Kirsten has studiously avoided being in charge, but has found a joy and deep competence in being able to ensure the groups she is in are cohesive and able to progress rapidly to their goals.

She is ready to help you to unlock your superpowers of followership, to see how you contribute to the group(s) you are in, even when you're not leading them.

